                    {
                        "sense_id": "84dc5f4c-80dd-3e62-a219-dc9d2f2134a4",
                        "entry_id": "bb377290-2f64-32bd-8d54-a0bf67e96ec3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Régime politique dont le pouvoir souverain est sous le contrôle de crétins."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "pejorative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ab4972d-edfd-441c-ad2f-5a48c4d66069",
                                "sense_id": "84dc5f4c-80dd-3e62-a219-dc9d2f2134a4",
                                "text": "Toutefois, je le pense aujourd’hui plus que jamais, d’autant plus que la forme de gouvernement la plus répandue dans le monde d’aujourd’hui, c’est le crétinocratie, phase ultime de l’évolution du Weltgeist hégélien dans l’histoire universelle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe06c124-af64-4813-975e-fc1dc1d89163",
                                "sense_id": "84dc5f4c-80dd-3e62-a219-dc9d2f2134a4",
                                "text": "Ce qu’ils construisent, c’est une crétinocratie à leurs dimensions."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bd111dee-fb92-42c3-aa24-a7d9b7de56e1",
                        "source_entry_id": "bb377290-2f64-32bd-8d54-a0bf67e96ec3",
                        "source_sense_id": "84dc5f4c-80dd-3e62-a219-dc9d2f2134a4",
                        "target_lang_word": "boobocracy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "boobocracy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3020b9a2-64b3-30e8-9101-0499ce25b916",
                                        "entry_id": "dd234627-15f5-3c31-9035-4a988eb1ee61",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rule by the ignorant and uneducated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f3a7f6c-ade8-4964-8981-83b6f5f99d37",
                                                "sense_id": "3020b9a2-64b3-30e8-9101-0499ce25b916",
                                                "text": "The revelations about the Ku Klux Klan have told us nothing, except that what Mr. Mencken calls the \"booboisie\" is obviously a docile imitator of the boobocracy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "daaac12b-c188-4030-bec9-8879535cb50b",
                                                "sense_id": "3020b9a2-64b3-30e8-9101-0499ce25b916",
                                                "text": "And, if a boobocracy, why not play on it for profit? What else is it for?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d5b45e0-eaa0-4a37-b241-bb368667839e",
                                                "sense_id": "3020b9a2-64b3-30e8-9101-0499ce25b916",
                                                "text": "Henry L. Mencken could come up from Baltimore to spread terror among the boobocracy, and vanquish weekly the ministers, college professors, and chambers of commerce."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f6bf44e-5297-4198-8a64-d7c15f4f00b8",
                                                "sense_id": "3020b9a2-64b3-30e8-9101-0499ce25b916",
                                                "text": "But in spite of the antics of its Bible thumpers and its boobocracy, my father was unable to stay mad at the United States for long."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
